          "task": "Implementasikan fungsi `centered_rbf_kpca_and_geodesic(X, gamma=0.02, k_nn=6)` menggunakan NumPy dan `scipy.sparse.csgraph.dijkstra` (tanpa Scikit-Learn!) yang: (1) menghitung matriks jarak Euclidean `D_euc` dan matriks Gram RBF $K_{ij} = \\exp(-\\gamma D_{ij}^2)$; (2) menerapkan pemusatan ganda $\\tilde{\\mathbf{K}}$ lalu menghitung `center_err = max|mean baris K_tilde|` dan rasio energi top-2 nilai eigen positif `top2_ratio = sum(pos[:2]) / sum(pos)` (untuk eigen $> 10^{-10}$); serta (3) membangun graf $k$-NN simetris berbobot jarak Euclidean, menghitung matriks jarak geodesik `D_geo` lewat `dijkstra(..., directed=False)`, dan menghitung rasio jarak rata-rata `geo_euc_ratio = mean(D_geo[triu]) / mean(D_euc[triu])`. Kembalikan `(round(center_err, 8), round(top2_ratio, 4), round(geo_euc_ratio, 4))`.",
          "starterCode": "import numpy as np\nfrom scipy.sparse import csr_matrix\nfrom scipy.sparse.csgraph import dijkstra\nfrom scipy.spatial.distance import cdist\n\ndef centered_rbf_kpca_and_geodesic(X, gamma: float = 0.02, k_nn: int = 6) -> tuple[float, float, float]:\n    X = np.asarray(X, dtype=float)\n    n = X.shape[0]\n    # TODO: hitung D_euc, K RBF, pemusatan ganda K_tilde, rasio top-2 eigen positif,\n    #       lalu bangun graf k-NN simetris -> dijkstra -> rasio mean geodesic / mean euclidean\n    pass\n\nrng = np.random.default_rng(201)\nt_s = np.linspace(1.5 * np.pi, 4.5 * np.pi, 60)\nh_s = rng.uniform(0.0, 6.0, 60)\nX_s = np.column_stack([t_s * np.cos(t_s), h_s, t_s * np.sin(t_s)])\nprint(centered_rbf_kpca_and_geodesic(X_s, gamma=0.02, k_nn=6))",
